# Unauthorized Exit: "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand. Surveil 1." Bot1 returns Bot2's Ornithopter to Bot2's hand (its owner's), not Bot1's, then
# surveils 1 and puts the Forest on top into the graveyard (CR 701.25a). Bot2's land is refused as a target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Island
Unauthorized Exit
Island x5
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Unauthorized Exit.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain)
Bot1.Hand.Unauthorized Exit.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Forest)
? Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain
? Bot2.Hand = Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Ornithopter

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Unauthorized Exit; Forest
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
